6.050" end="00:59.380"><span begin="00:56.050" end="00:56.290">And </span><span begin="00:56.290" end="00:56.650">I </span><span begin="00:56.650" end="00:57.100">can </span><span begin="00:57.100" end="00:57.550">tell </span><span begin="00:57.550" end="00:57.970">just </span><span begin="00:57.970" end="00:58.450">what </span><span begin="00:58.450" end="00:58.810">you </span><span begin="00:58.810" end="00:59.380">want</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.130" end="01:03.400"><span begin="01:00.130" end="01:00.400">You </span><span begin="01:00.400" end="01:00.580">don't </span><span begin="01:00.580" end="01:01.000">want </span><span begin="01:01.000" end="01:01.390">to </span><span begin="01:01.390" end="01:01.960">be </span><span begin="01:01.960" end="01:03.400">alone</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.580" end="01:07.750"><span begin="01:03.580" end="01:03.850">You </span><span begin="01:03.850" end="01:04.030">don't </span><span begin="01:04.030" end="01:04.480">want </span><span begin="01:04.480" end="01:04.840">to </span><span begin="01:04.840" end="01:05.410">be </span><span begin="01:05.410" end="01:07.750">alone</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.880" end="01:13.570"><span begin="01:09.880" end="01:10.120">And </span><span begin="01:10.120" end="01:10.480">I </span><span begin="01:10.480" end="01:10.870">can't </span><span begin="01:10.870" end="01:11.440">say </span><span begin="01:11.440" end="01:11.800">it's </span><span begin="01:11.800" end="01:12.250">what </span><span begin="01:12.250" end="01:12.520">you </span><span begin="01:12.520" end="01:13.570">know</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.900" end="01:17.260"><span begin="01:13.900" end="01:14.230">But </span><span begin="01:14.230" end="01:14.380">you've </span><span begin="01:14.380" end="01:14.920">known </span><span begin="01:14.920" end="01:15.220">it </span><span begin="01:15.220" end="01:15.610">the </span><span begin="01:15.610" end="01:16.060">whole </span><span 