span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:55.300" end="01:58.690"><span begin="01:55.300" end="01:55.660">You </span><span begin="01:55.660" end="01:55.870">don't </span><span begin="01:55.870" end="01:56.260">want </span><span begin="01:56.260" end="01:56.650">to </span><span begin="01:56.650" end="01:57.220">be </span><span begin="01:57.220" end="01:58.690">alone</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:58.840" end="02:03.040"><span begin="01:58.840" end="01:59.110">You </span><span begin="01:59.110" end="01:59.320">don't </span><span begin="01:59.320" end="01:59.710">want </span><span begin="01:59.710" end="02:00.130">to </span><span begin="02:00.130" end="02:00.700">be </span><span begin="02:00.700" end="02:03.040">alone</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:05.140" end="02:08.860"><span begin="02:05.140" end="02:05.380">And </span><span begin="02:05.380" end="02:05.710">I </span><span begin="02:05.710" end="02:06.130">can't </span><span begin="02:06.130" end="02:06.730">say </span><span begin="02:06.730" end="02:07.030">it's </span><span begin="02:07.030" end="02:07.540">what </span><span begin="02:07.540" end="02:07.780">you </span><span begin="02:07.780" end="02:08.860">know</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:09.160" end="02:12.460"><span begin="02:09.160" end="02:09.490">But </span><span begin="02:09.490" end="02:09.640">you've </span><span begin="02:09.640" end="02:10.180">known </span><span begin="02:10.180" end="02:10.480">it </span><span begin="02:10.480" end="02:10.870">the </span><span begin="02:10.870" end="02:11.290">whole </span><span begin="02:11.290" end="02:12.460">time</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:12.610" end="02:16.600"><span begin="02:12.610" end="02:12.910">Yeah</span><span begin="02:12.910" end="02:12.910">, </span><span begin="02:12.910" end="02:13.120">you've </span><span begin="02:13.120" end="02:13.630">known </span><span begin="02:13.630" end="02:13.960">it </span><span begin="02:13.960" end="02:14.350">the </span><span begin="02:14